            <ArticleTitle>MR imaging of edematous anconeus epitrochlearis: another cause of medial elbow pain?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>103-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two patients with unusual medial elbow pain had MRI scans performed that revealed edema of the aberrant muscle of the anconeus epitrochlearis. MRI of this anconeus epitrochlearis muscle are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
